                {"question": "In the case study scenario, why is unpivoting needed before grouping the data by category and month?", "options": ["Unpivoting is unnecessary if you group afterward", "Grouping by month requires the data to already be in a long format with Month as its own column", "Grouping only works on wide-format data", "Unpivoting and grouping are unrelated operations"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Group By needs Month as an actual column value to group on, which only exists after unpivoting the wide monthly columns."},
                {"question": "What is emphasized as the key skill in planning a pipeline like today's case study?", "options": ["Randomly applying transformations until the output looks right", "Deliberately sequencing cleaning, reshaping, and merging steps in a logical order", "Avoiding Power Query entirely for messy data", "Only ever using one transformation step regardless of data complexity"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "A reliable pipeline results from planning the correct step sequence, not improvising transformations in random order."}
