                {"question": "What is the purpose of the 'Filters' zone in a PivotTable?", "options": ["It permanently deletes filtered-out data from the source", "It lets you narrow the entire pivot report to a specific slice, like one year or category", "It has no functional effect", "It only works with text fields, never numbers"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Filters restrict the whole pivot table view to a chosen subset without altering the underlying data."},
