                {"question": "What does the UNIQUE function return?", "options": ["A count of total rows", "Only the distinct, non-repeated values from a list or range", "The sum of all values", "The single largest value in a range"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "UNIQUE extracts distinct values, removing duplicates, from the specified array or range."},
